## Viewing the PDF Documentation

**Note to users**: GitHub may show "Unable to render code block" when trying to view the PDF directly. To properly view the documentation:

1. Click on the file "mobile app documentation final2.pdf"
2. Look for the download button (down arrow icon) in the top right corner
3. Download the file to your local device
4. Open the downloaded file with any PDF reader

If you don't see a download button, you can also:
- Click the "Raw" button, then save the file from your browser
- Or add "?raw=true" to the end of the URL to force download

For any issues accessing the documentation, please contact the repository owner.
